{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06634","headline":"洛中贻朝校书衡朝即日本人也 · 储光羲","name":"洛中贻朝校书衡朝即日本人也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万国朝天中，东隅道最长。\n吾生美无度，高驾仕春坊。\n出入蓬山里，逍遥伊水傍。\n伯鸾游太学，中夜一相望。\n落日悬高殿，秋风入洞房。\n屡言相去远，不觉生朝光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}